# Input graph for TestU7.test_delete_template_tt_object_removes_reification.
# rdflib 7.2.1 cannot hold a triple term, so each reification is a plain
# `?r rdf:reifies ex:ttN` (the object stands for the triple term).  stmt1 is
# the reifier the test reads back; stmt2 reifies another triple, and r3 has a
# different :confidence -- neighbours that must survive.
@prefix : <http://example.org/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
:stmt1 rdf:reifies :tt1 ; :confidence "0.9" .
:stmt2 rdf:reifies :tt2 ; :confidence "0.5" .
:other :confidence "0.9" .
